# Complete v1 Acceptance and Delivery

Status: NOT_STARTED
Milestone: M5 Finished application
Dependencies: 13_COMPATIBILITY_QUALIFICATION.todo, 14_PACKAGING_RELEASE.todo, 15_USER_GUIDE.todo

## Purpose

Define 'complete app' as usable, qualified, recoverable, documented delivery, not just a working window.

## Tasks

- [ ] Audit R01-R12, including native transcription, translucency, themes and bounded cursor behavior, against evidence.
- [ ] Confirm no unresolved required-mode content leak, data-loss defect, or unrecoverable hidden-window case.
- [ ] Obtain owner approval of readability, moving/editing, focus behavior, and presentation workflow.
- [ ] Confirm final package hash matches the qualified artifact and support documentation.
- [ ] Resolve license/distribution/signing/account permissions and obtain explicit publication authorization.
- [ ] Deliver the immutable artifact through the authorized destination, or record an agreed local-only handoff.
- [ ] Verify delivered artifact identity and clean-machine first-run/recovery behavior.
- [ ] Record maintenance/requalification/rollback ownership and mark obsolete compatibility claims historical.
- [ ] Update index, ledger, and local offload with exact delivered scope and open deferred items.

## Acceptance criteria

- [ ] R01-R12 are satisfied within supported native/audio/theme/capture/cursor boundaries.
- [ ] Docker is explicitly deferred until after this native release, not required for ordinary transcription.
- [ ] Owner UX acceptance, technical evidence, and distribution approval are separately recorded.
- [ ] No unfinished required work is hidden behind a DONE label or replaced by optional feature success.
- [ ] Public/local release status is exact; no unsupported promise of universal invisibility.

## Completion evidence

- None. No application has been implemented, accepted, packaged, or delivered.

## Completion log

- 2026-10-07 - Planned as the final v1 gate.
